@KulaHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5028
@clientId = 4

### List clients
GET {{KulaHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/
Accept: application/json

###

### Create contact for Dealer (ClientId 4)
### Use OriginType ExternalClient so the Functions app routes it to the outbound path.
POST {{KulaHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
	"organisationId": null,
	"firstName": "Taylor",
	"lastName": "Inbound1",
	"email": "taylor.inbound10@example.com",
	"postcode": "SW1A 1AA",
	"originType": "InternalApp"
}

###

### List contacts for Dealer after creating one
GET {{KulaHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/{{outboundClientId}}/contacts
Accept: application/json

###
